-- Module:User:Crocs/Collection_log/Manual
-- Manual collection-log acquisition sources for items that NO standard bucket
-- (Dropsline / Storeline / Recipe) can express -- e.g. Giant clam pearls, whose
-- tier is decided by the high-alchemy value of the item you feed the clam, so
-- there is no drop rate, shop price, or fixed recipe to read.
--
-- Pure data module: exposes `p.data` (a list of { id, name, source, rate }).
-- Module:User:Crocs/Collection_log/Source require()s this directly and joins the
-- rows in, filling the otherwise-red "missing" rows AND including them in the
-- Bucket:Collection_log_source output it writes. Just edit `data` below; the
-- Sandbox and the bucket writer both pick it up (re-save the writer host page to
-- refresh the bucket).

local p = {}

